rows.abstract:
Proposes to add a new section as Sec.5-H to the Right-of-Way Act, to read as follows:
(H) THE PROPERTY OWNER SHALL HAVE AN OPTION TO AVAIL OF TAX CREDITS ON REAL PROPERTY TAX . . . SHALL BE DOCUMENTED AS A TAX CREDIT CERTIFICATE (TCC) WITH THE BUREAU OF INTERNAL REVENUE (BIR) WHICH SHALL BE IMPLEMENTED UNDER THE FOLLOWING GUIDELINES:
(1) . . . MAY BE MADE AS A PARTIAL OR FULL MODE OF PAYMENT . . .;
(2) . . . MAY BE USED AGAINST ANY OTHER TAX LIABILITY . . .;
(3) . . . MAY BE TRANSFERRED THROUGH A SALE . . . TO A THIRD-PARTY  . . ., WHO MAY USE THE TCC AGAINST ANY OTHER TAX LIABILITY
